    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d418">

                <pb facs="0540" n="282" xml:id="pg282"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/1347a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. What is attitude Swedish Government toward cotton shipped from America to
                    Russia via Narvik, Norway, and through Sweden on through bills of lading?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
